# Internal Mailbox System - Re-Audit Resolution Report

Date: 2026-02-08
Based on:
- `REPORTS AND REVIEWS/MESSAGING & NOTIFICATION SYSTEM/mailbox_reaudit_report.md`

## Resolution Summary
All items listed in "Remaining Minor Gaps" are resolved, and additional security hardening has been implemented.

## Re-Audit Gaps - Final Status

| Item from Re-Audit | Previous Status | Final Status | Evidence |
|---|---|---|---|
| E2EE client-side implementation | Backend-only | Resolved | `client/src/lib/e2ee.ts`, `client/src/hooks/use-mailbox.tsx`, `client/src/hooks/use-notifications.tsx`, `client/src/pages/AdminCommunications.tsx`, `client/src/components/Mailbox/MailboxMinitab.tsx` |
| Rich Text/Markdown rendering | Not done | Resolved | `client/src/components/Mailbox/MessageBody.tsx` |
